OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal by man jailed for killing
OL,4,Aex-partner thrown out
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who was jailed for murdering his
OL,7,Fex-partner has failed in his bid to
OL,8,Fchallenge his conviction.
OL,10,FDarren Osment was given a minimum of 20
OL,11,Fyears in prison in 2023 for killing
OL,12,F32-year-old Claire Holland, whose body
OL,13,Fwas never recovered. The mother-of-four
OL,14,Fwas last seen leaving a pub in Bristol
OL,15,Fon the evening of 6 June 2012.
OL,17,FThe former chef admitted to killing
OL,18,FHolland on multiple occasions,
OL,19,Fincluding to an undercover police
OL,20,Fofficer, but later retracted his
OL,21,Fconfessions.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
