OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal by man jailed for killing
OL,4,Aex-partner thrown out
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree judges at the Court of Appeal in
OL,7,FLondon dismissed the attempt to
OL,8,Fchallenge Osment's conviction earlier
OL,9,Fand rejected a bid to include fresh
OL,10,Fevidence.
